{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018Gd7qewDVn9LAetiMg7hxK","type":"tool_result","content":"8:billboards (rigs drawn at the size their distance gives, sprites, your own drawing) far to near.\n15:- In draw: m7.rig(rig, x, y, z), m7.sprite(spr or E.anim, x, y, z, { scale, flip, t }), m7.shape(id, x, y, z, { facing,\n16:  size }) (full engine), m7.add(x, y, z, (g, sx, sy, k) => ...) gather billboards (k: screen pixels per world unit there); m7.draw(r, cam) draws sky, floor, fog and them,\n21:  view(k) (the engine view a rig is drawn with at k).\n33:body's angle and the camera's heading are the same angle; billboards are gathered again every frame.\n40: * MODE 7  a perspective floor a row at a time, its sky, billboards scaled by distance\n44:const trig = a => { let c = Math.cos(a), s = Math.sin(a); if (Math.abs(c) < 1e-12) c = 0; if (Math.abs(s) < 1e-12) s = 0; return [c, s]; };\n51:     *  items: the billboards gathered for the next draw */\n58:    const a = o.angle !== undefined ? o.angle : b.angle || 0, back = o.back === undefined ? 56 : o.back, [c, s] = trig(a);","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6a22e8e-f9ad-4c1e-b19f-6f268b0ad619","uuid":"3cd325fe-3a0c-4a4a-b045-2cad098637e1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:00:09.043Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"8:billboards (rigs drawn at the size their distance gives, sprites, your own drawing) far to near.\n15:- In draw: m7.rig(rig, x, y, z), m7.sprite(spr or E.anim, x, y, z, { scale, flip, t }), m7.shape(id, x, y, z, { facing,\n16:  size }) (full engine), m7.add(x, y, z, (g, sx, sy, k) => ...) gather billboards (k: screen pixels per world unit there); m7.draw(r, cam) draws sky, floor, fog and them,\n21:  view(k) (the engine view a rig is drawn with at k).\n33:body's angle and the camera's heading are the same angle; billboards are gathered again every frame.\n40: * MODE 7  a perspective floor a row at a time, its sky, billboards scaled by distance\n44:const trig = a => { let c = Math.cos(a), s = Math.sin(a); if (Math.abs(c) < 1e-12) c = 0; if (Math.abs(s) < 1e-12) s = 0; return [c, s]; };\n51:     *  items: the billboards gathered for the next draw */\n58:    const a = o.angle !== undefined ? o.angle : b.angle || 0, back = o.back === undefined ? 56 : o.back, [c, s] = trig(a);","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018Gd7qewDVn9LAetiMg7hxK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
